# KEY VELOCITY (app/smk37.c lsmk_kv_*): how hard the 37 keys play, in LOOM-8 (Setup's SEL list, the last key's
# velocity under it) and in DAW mode (PATCH held + K8, the setting and the last key on the screen); kept with DAW mode's
# settings (OBJ_DAW). The touches hand the keys a time base (fm1-base plat_key_touch: heavy 1, the earlier builds' ..
# normal 4, the default .. lightest 8); FIXED 100 / 127 every key that velocity. The pads keep their own
wait 300
expect kv 3
expect touch 4
# Setup: KEY VELOCITY, normal -> fixed 100
tap GLO
turn SELECT 5
expect page Setup
tap SEL
row KEY VELOCITY
shot keyvel_setup.png
turn ALGO 4
expect kv 7
expect touch 4
keyvel 0 30
key 0 down
wait 40
key 0 up
wait 40
shot keyvel_last.png
tap HOME
wait 40
# DAW mode: the keys and the outer keys at 100 (fixed), whatever they were played at
smkbtn < down
smkbtn > down
wait 40
smkbtn > up
smkbtn < up
wait 60
expect daw 1
out
key 0 down
wait 20
expect_out USB 90 35 64
key 0 up
wait 20
outer 0 90
wait 20
expect_out USB 90 30 64
outer 0 0
wait 20
# PATCH held + K8 (the simulator's K4: the FM-1's KNOB 4): down to heavy (the touch 1), the keys as played again
press HOME
turn K4 -9
wait 40
shot keyvel_daw.png
release HOME
expect kv 0
expect touch 1
expect local 0
key 0 down
wait 20
expect_out USB 90 35 1E
key 0 up
wait 20
# K8 up one: firm (the touch 2); kept in flash, with DAW mode's settings (rsv: KEY VELOCITY + 1)
press HOME
turn K4 1
release HOME
expect kv 1
expect touch 2
wait 2000
expect kvobj 2
